    {
      "id": "5.8.3",
      "label": "5.8.3",
      "numbers": [
        3
      ],
      "devanagari": "न तत्र किंचिन्न कृतम् प्रयत्नतो |\nन तत्र किंचिन्न महर्हरत्नवत् |\nन ते विशेषा नियताः सुरेष्वपि |\nन तत्र किंचिन्न महाविशेषवत्",
      "iast": "na tatra kiṃcinna kṛtam prayatnato |\nna tatra kiṃcinna maharharatnavat |\nna te viśeśhā niyatāḥ sureśhvapi |\nna tatra kiṃcinna mahāviśeśhavat",
      "translation": "In that plane there is not even a small thing that is not made with great effort, in that there is nothing without the best diamonds, those characteristics definitely are not in Devas also, in that there is nothing that is not of great significance.",
