      "label": "5.8.6",
      "numbers": [
        6
      ],
      "devanagari": "वहन्ति यम् कुण्डशोभितानना |\nमहाशना व्योमचरा निशाचराः |\nविवृत्तविध्वस्तविशाललोचना |\nमहाजवा भूतगणाः सहस्रशः",
      "iast": "vahanti yam kuṇḍaśobhitānanā |\nmahāśanā vyomacarā niśācarāḥ |\nvivṛttavidhvastaviśālalocanā |\nmahājavā bhūtagaṇāḥ sahasraśaḥ",
      "translation": "Hanuma saw that aerial plane which rakshasas who were great eaters, with a face beautified by earnings, who roamed around in the sky and thousands of genii with round eyes, crooked eyes and wide eyes capable of great speed carrying it.",
