    {
      "id": "5.8.7",
      "label": "5.8.7",
      "numbers": [
        7
      ],
      "devanagari": "वसन्तपुष्पोत्करचारुदर्शनम् |\nवसन्तमासदपि कान्तदर्शनम् |\nस पुष्पकम् तत्र विमानमुत्तमम् |\nददर्श तद्वानरवीरसत्तमः",
      "iast": "vasantapuśhpotkaracārudarśanam |\nvasantamāsadapi kāntadarśanam |\nsa puśhpakam tatra vimānamuttamam |\ndadarśa tadvānaravīrasattamaḥ",
      "translation": "That Hanuma the best among Vanara warriors saw there a best plane with the name of Pushpaka with a more beautiful appearance than a group of flowers during spring, a more attractive appearance than even the spring season.",
